<title>Live Session 3: Apex Basics I — GCloudUp Tech</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #032D60;
    --blue: #00A1E0;
    --sky: #E8F4FC;
    --coral: #FF6B4A;
    --gold: #FFB75D;
    --green: #2E9E6B;
    --ink: #0B2A45;
